tukey includes code derived from the Cephes Math Library, as included in
SciPy's special functions library xsf (https://github.com/scipy/xsf).
xsf distributes Cephes under the 3-clause BSD licence with permission from
its author (https://lists.debian.org/debian-legal/2004/12/msg00295.html).

- internal/special/i0.go
    - I0 -> xsf/cephes/i0.h (method and Chebyshev coefficients)
    - chebyshev -> xsf/cephes/chbevl.h (Chebyshev series evaluation)

